          "x": 960,
          "y": 200
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "When the light mixed with the darkness, it made the darkness shine.",
          "es": "Cuando la luz se mezcló con la oscuridad, hizo brillar a la oscuridad."
        },
        {
          "en": "And when the darkness mixed with the light, it dimmed the light.",
          "es": "Y cuando la oscuridad se mezcló con la luz, apagó la luz."
        },
        {
          "en": "It was no longer light, and it was not darkness. It became weak and dim.",
          "es": "Ya no era luz, y no era oscuridad. Se volvió débil y opaca."
        }
      ]
